@startuml
title Lifecycle of a Pipeline build in Jenkins
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #EEF5FF
  BorderColor #335061
}
skinparam swimlane {
  BorderColor #335061
}
|Trigger|
start
:SCM webhook, cron, upstream job,
REST POST /job/X/build or CLI;
|Controller|
:Queue item created;
:Quiet period elapses
(close triggers merge into one build);
:Pipeline run starts,
Groovy script runs in the controller JVM
(CPS-transformed);
:node / agent block reached:
request an executor matching the label;
if (Free executor on a matching node?) then (yes)
  :Assign executor, allocate workspace;
else (no)
  :NodeProvisioner asks a Cloud
  for a new agent;
  |Agent|
  :Agent pod or VM starts,
  agent.jar connects back
  (inbound WebSocket or TCP);
  |Controller|
  :Assign executor on the new agent;
endif
|Agent|
:Run sh / bat steps in the workspace;
:Stream log back over Remoting;
|Controller|
:Write state to program.dat and
build directory under JENKINS_HOME;
:Archive artifacts, record tests,
run post conditions;
:Release executor
(cloud agent may be removed when idle);
stop
@enduml
